# Tic Tac Toe Game
# Problem - Two players play on a 3*3 board.
# One player is assigned X while other is assigned O -
# say player1 is assigned X and player2 is assigned O
# Players get their chance to mark in the board alternatively
# Game starts
# First player1 marks X on the board and the chance is switched
# Now player2 has to mark O on the board.
# And so on, until a player wins or a tie happens
# If any one of the row has all X or all O, then the game is won
# If any one of the column has all X or all O, then the game is won
# If any one of the diagonal has all X or all O, then the game is won
# If none of above happens and all board cells are full, the game is tie.


